{
  "version": "0.6.9",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-23T06:17:11+03:00",
  "notes": [
    "Adds a multi-select Exclude upgrades control to Minion Setup, so one or more upgrades such as Flycatcher can be removed from optimizer consideration.",
    "Persists excluded upgrades locally and includes them in saved table views.",
    "Improves one-time setup pricing: use a direct Bazaar acquisition price when available, otherwise price verified crafting recipes recursively from their ingredients.",
    "Adds verified recipes for the Minion upgrades currently modeled, including Flycatcher, Corrupt Soil, Soulflow engines, Berberis Fuel Injector, Super Compactor 3000, Diamond Spreading, Minion Expander and Enchanted Egg.",
    "Shows a setup-cost breakdown in the Minion detail dialog with the price source for every component (Bazaar, Craft or Coins).",
    "Keeps N/A only when a required setup component genuinely still cannot be priced from available market/recipe data."
  ],
